{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line joining the midpoints of the diagonals of a trapezoid has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If the longer base is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c2785e16c2045c5baf941b57511c04bab1ebc523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$97,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> then the shorter base is: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c37fe643e80c0ab3f49fedb710bd4ee9619ccf63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 94 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 92\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 91\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 90\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 89$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/0/68067696a74abf0cbeb277913e43d5b23f47b9d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  import geometry;  point B = (0,0); point A = (3,5); point D = (13,5); point C = (15,0); point M,N;  // Trapezoid draw(A--B--C--D--A); dot(A); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,NW); dot(B); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,SW); dot(C); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,SE); dot(D); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,NE);  // Diagonals and their midpoints draw(A--C); draw(B--D);  M = midpoint(A--C); dot(M); label(&quot;M&quot;,M,ENE);  N = midpoint(B--D); dot(N); label(&quot;N&quot;,N,WNW); draw(M--N);  // Length Labels label(&quot;$x$&quot;,midpoint(A--D),(0,1)); label(&quot;$97$&quot;,midpoint(B--C),S); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,midpoint(M--N),S);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"112\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the length of the shorter base. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b20d8ddcf01b59432cf1519f25f9da002df5db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = \\frac{97-x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fcec5d7aef856927e8153b7aa34c93aae1a2e97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 = 97-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f01d288e313680c4874e5a6c7827a8ec511289b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78cb35d6ca8359fcb5c1fd4b360c4b5ada9529eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }91}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the trapezoid be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b8758488fad26fef07e20a4510ec195b6ab75079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD} \\parallel \\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> as the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> as the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4373e7b4be983c0315e82e1fda1df66ed34dd7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" />, as in the diagram. As in the first solution, let the shorter base of the trapezoid (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />) have length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b8758488fad26fef07e20a4510ec195b6ab75079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD} \\parallel \\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"22\" />, we can imagine shifting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> along <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa5ae853879661bccaf47712a492ec2decc8fab8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overleftrightarrow{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"21\" /> by distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, at which point we get the following triangle:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0e9f72322e5c93062c1d316001b2a1b5c8e54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  import geometry;  size(10cm);  point B = (0,0); point C = (25,0); point A = (13,5); point M,N;  // Triangle ABC draw(A--B--C--A); dot(A); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,(0,1)); dot(B); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,SW); dot(C); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,SE);   // Midpoint connector M = midpoint(A--C); dot(M); label(&quot;M&quot;,M,NE); N = midpoint(B--A); dot(N); label(&quot;N&quot;,N,NW); draw(M--N);  // Length Labels label(&quot;$97+x$&quot;,midpoint(B--C),S); label(&quot;$3+x$&quot;,midpoint(M--N),S);  [/asy]\" width=\"475\" height=\"132\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31fc3d60a21c65a04974f46defd2d131f5c0111e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{MN}$\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint#Midsegments\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint connector</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf4128449c4da45dbbf5ccf4e9c013cc869a33ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN=\\frac{1}{2}BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />, and so we have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/e/d9ec5c40821857b5ca5a82d68014317cbfd178e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+x=\\frac{97+x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"123\" height=\"38\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031fda1fc2143c54c5854ea0bb40eeb6e5fc6e84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }91}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"101\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017162817\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 299/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6512/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.251      1 -total\n 61.25%    9.341      1 Template:AHSME_50p_box\n 36.82%    5.615      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16676:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017162817 and revision id 223306. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}